<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON ORDER OF PLAY ON THE SHOW COURTS ON TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON ORDER OF PLAY ON THE SHOW COURTS ON TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tuesday's singles order of play for</p>
<p>fourth round matches on the show courts at the Wimbledon tennis</p>
<p>championships (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Centre Court (starts 1100GMT)</p>
<p>8-Aranxta Sanchez Vicario (Spain) v 9-Mary Pierce (France)</p>
<p>9-Marcelo Rios (Chile) v 8-Boris Becker (Germany)</p>
<p>14-Tim Henman (Britain) v 4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands)</p>
<p>Court One (1100GMT)</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) v Richey Reneberg (U.S.)</p>
<p>11-Mary Joe Fernandez v 3-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v 16-Petr Korda (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>Court Two (1000GMT)</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v Sabine Appelmans (Belgium)</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) v Nicolas Kiefer (Germany)</p>
<p>Court Three (1000GMT)</p>
<p>12_Pat Rafter (Australia) v Todd Woodbridge (Australia)</p>
<p>Helena Sukova (Czech Republic) v Anna Kournikova (Russia)</p>
</text>
